Template: dreamweaver/title
Type: title
Description: Dreamweaver

Template: dreamweaver/session
Type: select
Choices: xorg, wayland, headless
Default: xorg
Description: Graphical session:
 Dreamweaver has no display manager. The session starts on login.
 .
 xorg installs dwm, st, dmenu and sxac. This is the default.
 .
 wayland installs dwl and the Wayland tools instead.
 .
 headless installs no graphical software at all.

Template: dreamweaver/extras
Type: multiselect
Choices: extra, development, gaming, virtualization
Default:
Description: Optional software:
 None of these are required. Each can also be added later by re-running the
 installer script on the installed system.
 .
 extra: Signal, Brave, LibreOffice, Bluetooth, a torrent client.
 .
 development: VSCodium, Docker, compilers, SQLite tools, and a second account
 that shares your configuration.
 .
 gaming: Steam and the 32-bit graphics drivers. Enables non-free packages.
 .
 virtualization: QEMU, KVM and libvirt, with their services left disabled.
